# Submits the organizer-provided natural-language instruction to the local
# mission interpreter (/edge/submit_mission). accepted只表示指令已接收并分配
# mission_id；解析和验证结果异步发布于/edge/mission_intake，通过验证的计划
# 由验证器发布于/edge/mission_plan。
string run_id
string original_instruction
---
bool accepted
string mission_id
string message
